The  driver  provides support for IGA 1682 and CyberPro series of
graphics cards by InteGraphics Systems, now Tvia.  The driver op‐
erates these cards in linear framebuffer mode, not in  VGA  mode.
The  driver  first appeared in There’s currently no way to change
resolution, frequency, etc.  The driver is hardcoded to init  the
card to 1024×768, 8bpp at 60Hz.
